      "raw_text": "The File That Contained the Keys Has Been Removed: An Empirical Analysis of Secret Leaks in Cloud Buckets and Responsible Disclosure Outcomes"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "tei:year",
      "source": "grobid_tei",
